{
    "_doc": [
        "make_posters.py's spec: everything on a description poster that the CAD",
        "does not know. Templates are str.format_map over make_posters.values():",
        "every derived variable (calTotalCards, HorizontalSlots, ...) plus ext_w,",
        "ext_d, ext_h, card_w, card_h, card_size, slot_cards, slots, grid,",
        "model_ref, printer, sleeving, plus the row's own keys. A game entry",
        "overrides the defaults; a row entry ('<Game>/<Short name>' or, for FCM,",
        "'<Game>/<Project label>') overrides its game. 'layout' is the poster in",
        "4000x3000 canvas units, one element per entry, overridden by name in a",
        "game's or row's 'layout'; 'hide' lists element names to skip."
    ],
